{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a determined programmer in 'Game is Full of Bugs,' who finds himself unexpectedly drafted into a desperate struggle against an alien invasion of bugs. Despite being brought into the fray under the guise of a misunderstanding, his knowledge and craftiness quickly proves invaluable in this dire situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/720b87a2c9ddd59d87b404f95f3830fb.poster.avif?t=1772012694\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/720b87a2c9ddd59d87b404f95f3830fb.webm?t=1772012694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/720b87a2c9ddd59d87b404f95f3830fb.mp4?t=1772012694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect leftover pieces of  fallen bugs and use them to craft unique bullets and modules and then loop through them as you shoot. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/0fa94c90020344c58295c20abcbd236d.poster.avif?t=1772012694\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/0fa94c90020344c58295c20abcbd236d.webm?t=1772012694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/0fa94c90020344c58295c20abcbd236d.mp4?t=1772012694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new bullet types, experiment with countless module and item combinations and create the ultimate weapon to combat the bug incursion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/743c5f90c7092bdb81b46e44d980f633.poster.avif?t=1772012694\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/743c5f90c7092bdb81b46e44d980f633.webm?t=1772012694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/743c5f90c7092bdb81b46e44d980f633.mp4?t=1772012694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique suits and starting items, and try different combinations to find the best setup for the challenge at hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/42e16438c342e81b12f011d349317708.poster.avif?t=1772012694\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/42e16438c342e81b12f011d349317708.webm?t=1772012694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/42e16438c342e81b12f011d349317708.mp4?t=1772012694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the randomly generated hive, fight your way through hordes of bugs and eliminate the queen that lurks within.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2868030?t=1772012694","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2868030?t=1772012694","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/c8202409f9057e101035908162559bb7cde044a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772012694","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/c8202409f9057e101035908162559bb7cde044a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772012694","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a determined programmer in 'Game is Full of Bugs,' who finds himself unexpectedly drafted into a desperate struggle against an alien invasion of bugs. Despite being brought into the fray under the guise of a misunderstanding, his knowledge and craftiness quickly proves invaluable in this dire situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/720b87a2c9ddd59d87b404f95f3830fb.poster.avif?t=1772012694\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/720b87a2c9ddd59d87b404f95f3830fb.webm?t=1772012694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/720b87a2c9ddd59d87b404f95f3830fb.mp4?t=1772012694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect leftover pieces of  fallen bugs and use them to craft unique bullets and modules and then loop through them as you shoot. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/0fa94c90020344c58295c20abcbd236d.poster.avif?t=1772012694\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868030/extras/0fa94c90020344c58295c20